# Premium UI and motion

Prefer native CSS for small interactions. Do not scroll-jack. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`, keyboard focus, and touch.

Motion that belongs: image reveals, navigation, project hover, and form or calendar feedback. Check the hero, services, quote form, menu, and footer on desktop and a narrow screen before calling a visual change done.
